回。现在我是死生之律者，也是天命医疗队的队长。我和另一个我共同分享『希儿』这个名字，如今我们已经分离成了两个独立的个体。我相信为世界上所有的美好而战，想保护重要的人。"}},"mem_links":[{"id":"f32980b0-3ee4-45be-affa-b87874043edb","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-b118-43edea483d8e","to":"d73761d5-8309-469e-94c1-4747fe8cf6ba","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"依赖","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"5b538713-e2e6-4bcd-b02b-1940febdad84","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-b118-43edea483d8e","to":"3d929e27-2956-44d2-8f93-f193e98c5e4f","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"共存","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"595e6e46-029c-4012-ae3a-50a2bbae1994","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-b118-43edea483d8e","to":"6523a4ad-dcda-44dd-ba0e-24d05cc9dd53","intensity":0.7,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"被抚养","confidence":0.7}}},{"id":"712ef38c-d5dd-4d43-8c93-22ca9bf6a193","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-b118-43edea483d8e","to":"ab075e0b-af3f-4314-b564-ce9f8f5fbb1f","intensity":0.5,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"同伴","confidence":0.5}}},{"id":"e97c90d5-cbbc-4a08-90d3-a4c489d98069","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-b118-43edea483d8e","to":"6190f581-1169-4592-8ac3-7b5da2d6a915","intensity":0.6,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"朋友","confidence":0.6}}},{"id":"eadb2f3f-5250-49cb-bb20-578e10899bdf","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-b118-43edea483d8e","to":"1f9c551b-0cd0-4d35-8219-9d685cb8af14","intensity":0.6,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"朋友","confidence":0.6}}},{"id":"0ba5a108-fe49-43cc-a3be-6ccd7d702001","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-b118-43edea483d8e","to":"5d24537e-932c-4855-820d-cb5b88c805da","intensity":0.4,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"遭遇","confidence":0.4}}},{"id":"92cdb405-7e6f-4bf0-900a-c42bb235290e","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-b118-43edea483d8e","to":"246f7b99-478c-48ad-b125-843caf94dd8a","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"所属","confidence":0.8}}},{"id":"0cc332d0-9ee1-4713-986b-b3c98714c7ec","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-b118-43edea483d8e","to":"28358106-dc4f-4d0a-90c9-2ad869b2dded","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"经历","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"f59e1da0-df7c-4fd5-933a-ca7978cfb7f7","from":"978b9103-6fab-444a-